      "example_num": 1,
      "example_text": "Input: nums = [3,3,3]\nOutput: \"equilateral\"\nExplanation: Since all the sides are of equal length, therefore, it will form an equilateral triangle.",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "example_num": 2,
      "example_text": "Input: nums = [3,4,5]\nOutput: \"scalene\"\nExplanation: \nnums[0] + nums[1] = 3 + 4 = 7, which is greater than nums[2] = 5.\nnums[0] + nums[2] = 3 + 5 = 8, which is greater than nums[1] = 4.\nnums[1] + nums[2] = 4 + 5 = 9, which is greater than nums[0] = 3. \nSince the sum of the two sides is greater than the third side for all three cases, therefore, it can form a triangle.\nAs all the sides are of different lengths, it will form a scalene triangle.",
      "images": []
    }
  ],
